  "notes": "{背|せ} refers to height/stature or the back of the body.\n\nHEIGHT EXPRESSIONS:\n- {背|せ}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{高|たか}い→高い：00500_takai⟧: tall\n- {背|せ}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{低|ひく}い→低い：02947_hikui⟧: short\n- {背|せ}⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{伸|の}びる→伸びる：01974_nobiru⟧: to grow taller\n- {背|せ}⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{順|じゅん}→順：03342_jun⟧: in order of height\n\nBACK EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{背中|せなか}→背中：00810_senaka⟧: back (of body) - most common\n- {背|せ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{向|む}ける→向ける：02306_mukeru⟧: to turn one's back\n- {背|せ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{伸|の}ばす→伸ばす：01973_nobasu⟧: to straighten one's back\n- {背|せ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{押|お}す→押す：02854_osu⟧: to push from behind; to encourage\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{身長|しんちょう}→身長：03263_shinchou⟧: height (formal measurement)\n- ⟦{背丈|せたけ}→背丈：16140_setake⟧: stature, height\n- ⟦{背骨|せぼね}→背骨：17397_sebone⟧: spine, backbone\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n{背|せ}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{腹|はら}→腹：02165_hara⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{代|か}えられない→代える：11717_kaeru⟧: necessity knows no law",
